      ],
      "context_support_ratio": 1.0,
      "failure_surface": "synthesis_gap",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "bonogo": "evidence_gap",
        "caelynn": "evidence_gap",
        "thalia": "hit",
        "wolf": "hit",
        "guards": "hit",
        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The chamber fight includes the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including elite ones); council members are not explicitly confirmed present in the provided context.\n\nBased on OBSERVED and CANON facts:\n- Players: Actively involved in the council interaction and subsequent battle; \u201cThe players recount their story to the council\u201d and are engaged when the fight breaks out.\n- the Wolf: Explicitly present in the \u201cCouncil Room\u201d and is the central adversary of the encounter.\n- Thalia: Present with the Wolf (\u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder\u201d) and participates in combat after his command.\n- Guards: Present in force\u2014some already inside and more \u201cbeing drawn here as reinforcements,\u201d including regular and elite guards who engage the party.\n\nNotably absent:\n- Council members are implied by the setting (a council session), but there is no explicit fact confirming their physical presence during the fight.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Location: Large circular council chamber with magical defenses and a hidden trapdoor\n- Defenses: Illusory walls, runes, arcane effects impacting combat\n- Active combatants: Players, Wolf, Thalia, Guards (8 regular + 2 elite per OBSERVED demographics)\n- Reinforcements: Guards continue arriving during the encounter",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_longmont_campaign_general_notes_1",
